      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Liberty Blue Estate Agents are delighted to present 7 Maypark Mews to the market – a bright, spacious and beautifully maintained two-bedroom apartment offering generous accommodation, excellent storage and a private balcony overlooking Waterpark Rugby Club. \r\n\r\nSet within a small residential development, No. 7 is positioned on the second floor and is served by elevator access, making it a particularly comfortable and convenient option for a wide range of buyers. The apartment has been owner-occupied for a number of years and appears to be well maintained. \r\nOne of the first things you notice on entering is the sense of space. The accommodation is well proportioned, with a practical layout that makes excellent use of the available floor area.\r\n\r\nThe main living accommodation is bright, airy and inviting, with the kitchen and dining area connecting naturally with the adjoining living room. This creates a sociable space that works equally well for everyday living or entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe living area opens directly onto a private balcony overlooking Waterpark Rugby Club, providing an attractive open outlook and a welcome outdoor space. Whether it is a morning coffee or somewhere to unwind at the end of the day, the balcony is a lovely addition to the apartment and gives the main living space an even greater feeling of openness.\r\n\r\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms, providing flexibility for an owner-occupier, couple or someone who would like a second bedroom for guests or a home office. Storage is another real strength of No. 7. Two separate cloakrooms/storage cupboards are located off the hallway, providing valuable space for coats, household items and everyday storage, an important practical feature that is not always available in apartment living.\r\n\r\nCommunal parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis.\r\n\r\nAnnual Management Fees are €1850.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Maypark Mews is ideally positioned close to Ardkeen and the Dunmore Road, placing an excellent range of amenities within easy reach. University Hospital Waterford is nearby, together with shopping, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and a wide range of everyday services.\r\n\r\nWaterpark Rugby Club is directly adjacent to the development, with the apartment enjoying views across the grounds from its balcony. Waterford city centre is also easily accessible, while the Dunmore Road provides convenient access towards some of Waterford's most popular coastal areas.\r\n\r\nFor buyers who want the convenience of apartment living but don't want to compromise on space, storage or location, No. 7 Maypark Mews is a particularly appealing option.\r\nWith its two bedrooms, two bathrooms, generous living accommodation, private balcony, elevator access and superb location, this is a home that offers both practicality and lifestyle in equal measure.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space and setting No. 7 has to offer.\r\n\r\n***Liberty Blue Estate Agents and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied upon as a representation of fact. Subject to contract. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must satisfy themselves as to the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only.***"
      },
